Z||000000||MP5Na3||09-07-2001||02:18 PM||||Always wanted to have lambo style doors on my fiero.  Finally decided to do something about it.  Finaly have figured out most of the trip-ups in designing this (weight of door/door pivoting out before going up/so forth and so on), and am going to start actual metalwork on my spare (every fiero owner has atleast one spare fiero laying around don't they, come on guys, make me feel better and convince my wife I am not a total fanatic).  Anyhow, I have my own machine shop (full time gunsmith for 10 years) and was wondering if there would be an interest in this or should I just do mine and be really unique :-)<P>Have no idea on cost yet.  Just feeling the waters before diving in.  All opinions and comments are welcome.<P>Thanks much.<BR>||||reg||5
Z||000001||Joe Torma||09-07-2001||02:47 PM||||I've thought about it, and I kinda have an idea how to do it.  Make the door push out from the car a few inches then swing up.  My basic idea...a short section of tube fixed on the frame then another tube that fits inside the other thats attached to the door.  the tube would allow the door to swing up and down and in and out with hydraulic type lift supports.  You could a grease fitting on the tube.<P>Post your progress!  This would be cool!<BR>Oh, sorry no spare Fieros here...just lots of parts!<BR>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/simplesig.gif">   <BR>Did you get your car in my book yet????<BR> <A HREF="http://www.animatedconcepts.com/fierobook.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.animatedconcepts.com/fierobook.htm</A> <p>[This message has been edited by Joe Torma (edited 09-07-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroPerformance||09-07-2001||03:00 PM||||Post pics and prices, I wouldn't mind having a set but it depends on what mods have to be done to the actual car and how much it costs.<P>-Charlie||||reg||1
Z||000003||GodSend||09-07-2001||03:08 PM||||If it can be done with significant mods to the car (anything that will require welding, or repainting) then count me in!.  I know alot of lambo style hinges for kits run a few hundred bucks,... so if you could stay within that limit, im sure you will get enough business.. <P>let us know on the progress... ||||reg||1
